# statistics, paged like emit_c.a0 `cusn`: word v (node v; parameter v at 4096 + v) holds
# 2^16 * (operand uses other than operand 0 of a get/at) + (last user + 1). A value may be
# updated in place by node j at its target operand when it is fresh (arr text rec set put) or
# the owned parameter, is not the ret, its only such use is that operand, no later node uses
# it, and no borrow of it is read later (the shape table's BORR column).

