ret g
end
# a select group (the shape table's ARM 4 on its leader, `lazyArms` groups): one branch on the
# condition; each side's nodes (ARM 1 / 2, owned by the leader) on its own path, then every select
# of the group (ARM 3, owned by the leader, and the leader) sets its local to its operand of that
# side; a known condition emits its side only. The selects' locals are bound first, in node order.
# member test of node p1 of the frame (first node p2) for the leader p3
fn wxgmem u32 u32 u32 u32x128x310 -> bool
