# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The module linker (src/wasm.ts `assembleWasm`), mode 3. Input: the version (length, bytes),
# the io input and output capacities, the function count, the export list (a 0: every function
# is exported; n + 1: the n function names that are, each its length then its bytes), every
# chunk's POOL then a 0, every chunk's META, every chunk's CODE. Output: the module, one byte
# per word; the result is 0, 4 when a table below is full, or 6 when an exported name is no
# function of the program.
# Two pool tables u32x128x512. The first (bank A) holds the address of every literal occurrence
# (words 0-4095), a hash table of the distinct literals (2048 slots of hash, start, length, from 4096),
# the first distinct literals' words (from 10240 to 65534) and a scratch word (65535) for writes that
# do not apply; the second (bank B) the words of the literals that did not fit bank A (from 0). A
# literal is stored whole in one bank. The virtual address of a literal word is its word in A, or
# the number of words of A plus its word in B, so the pool is one run of words (131,000 in all;
# the pool of a program is a data segment of its words).
fn z500 -> u32x128x500
a call zpage
b arr a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a a
ret b
end
