# the word at virtual pool address p3: below the boundary p2 in bank A (table p0, from word 10240), else
# in bank B (table p1, from word p2); every pool word is read through here
# the words of the stored literal at virtual address p5 equal the p7 words of the new one at p6: word p1
fn wkcwv bool u32 u32x128x512 u32x128x512 u32 u32 u32 -> bool
